# 9B 对照实验队列（9B 全套 vs 2B 全套这一组）：名字|依赖|命令。两台单卡：准备阶段并行领任务；
# GRPO 用双机模式，先空出来的那台领 pair_infer 当推理机，另一台领 pair_train 当训练机（推理机域名由本地 scripts/pair_setup.py 写）。
prep||bash scripts/remote/q9b_task.sh prep
rm_rm1__core|prep|bash scripts/remote/q9b_task.sh rm rm1__core
sft_rag|prep|bash scripts/remote/q9b_task.sh sft_rag
rm_sat_pair__core|prep|bash scripts/remote/q9b_task.sh rm sat_pair__core
rm_refuse__core|prep|bash scripts/remote/q9b_task.sh rm refuse__core
ref9|sft_rag|bash scripts/remote/q9b_task.sh ref9
pair_infer|ref9,rm_rm1__core,rm_sat_pair__core,rm_refuse__core|bash scripts/remote/q9b_task.sh pair_infer
pair_train|ref9,rm_rm1__core,rm_sat_pair__core,rm_refuse__core|bash scripts/remote/q9b_task.sh pair_train
cap3|rm_rm1__core|bash scripts/remote/q9b_task.sh cap3
cmp|pair_train|bash scripts/remote/q9b_task.sh cmp
# 垫底任务：等第二台机器时不让第一台空着（单卡就能做的 9B 对比），排在最后，不抢 GRPO 的先
rm_sev__v3c0|prep|bash scripts/remote/q9b_extra.sh sev__v3c0
rm_rm2__v3b|prep|bash scripts/remote/q9b_extra.sh rm2__v3b
gen|prep|bash scripts/remote/q9b_task.sh gen
